### 4a  Malformed IP address
$ ./vehicle_ecu -m udp -i 192.168.1.300 -n 3
[ERROR] Invalid IP address '192.168.1.300' - expected dotted IPv4, e.g. 127.0.0.1
[exit code 2]

$ ./vehicle_ecu -m tcp -i 127.0.0.abc -n 3
[ERROR] Invalid IP address '127.0.0.abc' - expected dotted IPv4, e.g. 127.0.0.1
[exit code 2]

